OL,3,GNEWSAFunding secured for long-delayed
OL,4,Arailway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long-planned railway station serving
OL,7,Fa growing community on the western edge
OL,8,Fof Preston has moved a step closer to
OL,9,Fbecoming a reality after funding for
OL,10,Fthe project was finally secured.
OL,12,FLancashire's Combined County Authority
OL,13,F(LCCA) has approved #28.2m towards the
OL,14,Fconstruction of Cottam Parkway, a new
OL,15,Fstation on the line between Preston and
OL,16,FBlackpool.
OL,18,FThe money plugs a funding gap that had
OL,19,Fthreatened the future of the scheme,
OL,20,Fwhich was first proposed more than a
OL,21,Fdecade ago.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
